IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ddtr-dates`

-- Dust Diseases Tribunal Regulation 2019 (NSW), Part 2 and Schedule 1 -- the Tribunal's fees, from the seat of the
-- claimant (an individual: the corporation fee in Column 3 is out of this seat).
--
-- Provisions: cl 4(1)(b), (1A); cl 4A with Sch 1 Part 2 cl 2, 3 (the fee unit and rounding); cl 6 (pro bono parties);
-- cl 7 (pensioners and legally assisted parties); cl 9 (the first directions hearing fee); cl 10(1); Sch 1 Part 1 items 1-8,
-- 13-15 and 17 (the flat fees). Out: cl 4(1)(a), (2) (corporations), cl 5 (the Crown), cl 8 (who pays, beyond cl 9), the
-- per-page and per-request items 9-12 and the registry-opening item 16, and Sch 1 Part 2 cl 4 (publishing the fees).
--
-- The fee unit: Sch 1 Part 2 cl 2(1)(a) gives $103.05 for 2022-23; the CPI formula in cl 2(1)(b) was lost when the text
-- was converted (its variables A and B survive, the formula does not), so the units for 2023-24 ($110.93) and 2024-25
-- ($115.59) are taken from the Editorial note under cl 2, and later years answer NOTHING (findings 2 and 3).
--
